Append mode ("a")	Added expenses without erasing previous records
Read mode ("r")	Read saved expenses
file.write()	Wrote each expense as a line
for loop	Processed every saved expense
strip()	Removed surrounding whitespace and newline characters
split(",")	Separated descriptions and amounts
float()	Converted amounts between text and numeric values
try/except	Handled a missing expense file
FileNotFoundError	Identified when the file does not exist
replace()	Replaced commas in descriptions with spaces
title()	Formatted descriptions for display
Accumulator variable	Added expense amounts to calculate the total
while True	Repeated the menu
break and continue	Controlled menu execution


